        "title": "fix(tailscale): guard JSON.parse crash in hasTailscaleFunnelRouteForPort",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\n\n`hasTailscaleFunnelRouteForPort` crashes with `SyntaxError` when tailscale output is malformed JSON.\n\n## Why This Change Was Made\n\nWrap `parsePossiblyNoisyJsonObject` in try-catch that returns `false` (same as exec-failure).\n\n## User Impact\n\nPrevents crash during funnel health checks when tailscale returns malformed output.\n\n## Evidence\n\n**Runtime proof — JSON guard verified (Node 24):**\n\n![proof](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zhangLei99586/openclaw/proof-screenshots/pr-98649-proof-v2.png)\n\n- `hasTailscaleFunnelRouteForPort(99999, bad json) → false` — no SyntaxError\n- 30/30 tests passed ✅ (updated test: gracefully handles malformed JSON)",
